{"id": "59392", "title": "契丹曲之枕上奴", "author": "砌花凌乱红深浅", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 36, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/59/59392.htm", "intro": "属性分类：古代／特殊职业／一般言情／感动揪心\r\n关键字：奴桑儿 　耶律灼 　虐恋 \r\n只是宋辽边界的一个贫困民女，却不想因为招惹到了辽国的神秘男子，而从此开始走上了一条被各路豺狼一样的蛮夷男人堵截围攻的‘艰辛’之路，对她欲罢不能，视为贱奴的契丹王爷和皇子，还有逼她假冒公主的鬼畜和亲大臣。还有身份不明，总是要给她‘医病’的西夏男人，遇到这些奇葩还不够，最可怕的是，还要被人报复的绑架去蒙古，这些男人太凶了，，她要回家啊啊啊！！", "base": "files/article/html/59/59392", "chapters": [{"title": "1-7", "file": "8640983.html", "available": false}, {"title": "8-13", "file": "8640985.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14-19", "file": "8640989.html", "available": false}, {"title": "20-25", "file": "8640991.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-31", "file": "8640995.html", "available": false}, {"title": "32-36", "file": "8640997.html", "available": false}, {"title": "37-42", "file": "8640999.html", "available": false}, {"title": "43-48", "file": "8641000.html", "available": false}, {"title": "48-53", "file": "8641002.html", "available": false}, {"title": "54-58", "file": "8641004.html", "available": false}, {"title": "59-65", "file": "8641007.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-69", "file": "8641009.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-80", "file": "8641012.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-88", "file": "8641016.html", "available": false}, {"title": "90", "file": "8641018.html", "available": false}, {"title": "91-96", "file": "8641021.html", "available": false}, {"title": "97-104", "file": "8641022.html", "available": false}, {"title": "105-111", "file": "8641025.html", "available": false}, {"title": "112-117", "file": "8641027.html", "available": false}, {"title": "118-124", "file": "8641028.html", "available": false}, {"title": "125-129", "file": "8641030.html", "available": false}, {"title": "130-136", "file": "8641031.html", "available": false}, {"title": "137-143", "file": "8641034.html", "available": false}, {"title": "144-148", "file": "8641036.html", "available": 